WEBVTT

00:03:59.425 --> 00:04:01.978
not because it's missing in our capabilities

00:04:01.978 --> 00:04:03.598
or abilities,

00:04:03.598 --> 00:04:05.724
but because it's missing in the advice

00:04:05.724 --> 00:04:07.378
that we're given.

00:04:07.378 --> 00:04:09.147
Here's what I mean by that.

00:04:09.147 --> 00:04:11.338
Five years ago, I was asked to moderate

00:04:11.338 --> 00:04:13.171
a panel of executives,

00:04:13.171 --> 00:04:15.160
and the topic for the evening was

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.538
"What do you look for in 
high-potential employees?"

00:04:18.538 --> 00:04:21.620
So think about the three elements of leadership

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.410
as I summarize for you what they told me.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.907
They said, "We look for people

00:04:26.907 --> 00:04:30.563
who are smart and hard working and committed